Package: talis
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, curl, ca-certificates, libglib2.0-bin, libx11-6, libxext6, libxcb1, libxcb-shape0, librsvg2-common
Description: music-aware desktop turntable
 Rendered day and night desktop scenes with rotating artwork, a moving tonearm,
 and MPRIS playback controls. Includes 1080p, 1440p, and 4K scene assets.
 Supports native X11 desktops and GNOME Wayland with the included companion
 extension. Launch Talis to finish setup; new installations may need one
 logout/login. This build does not include native Wayland layer-shell.
